  "description": "The PC lens features higher transmittance than other materials,which provides a clearer & brighter lighting so that you can enjoy a pleasant & safe drive.\nFitment\n2002-2005 Dodge Ram 1500\n2003-2005 Dodge Ram 2500 3500\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nCompatibility: LED DRL Headlights assembly compatible with 2002-2005 Dodge Ram 1500/2003-2005 Dodge Ram 2500 3500; High beam bulb type: HB5; Low beam bulb type: HB5; Turn signal: 3157NA; Bulbs are not included; Professional installation would be highly recommended\nBrighter illumination: The metallic parabolic reflectors generate increased light output, producing a broader and more uniform beam distribution\nWaterproof: It is fully sealed with solid silicone and features one-way vent to prevent moisture trapping inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries, the headlights assembly maintains operational integrity in sorts of weather conditions\nImpact Resistance: The polycarbonate lens and rugged housing exhibit impact and vibration resistance, enabling reliable performance under extreme road conditions\nImprove Safety: The sided micro-prism reflectors enhance nighttime visibility by reflecting headlights beams back toward their source, enabling rapid detection by oncoming vehicles or pedestrians and improving safety for both the driver and surrounding road users",
